WEBVTT

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:26.390
Shoutmon took on the overwhelmingly 
strong DarknessBagramon alone, but...

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:31.440
Shoutmon!

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:40.460
<b>DigiXros of Glory,</b>

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:40.460
<b>Take Hold of Our Future!!</b>

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.680
DigiXros of Glory,

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:38.180
Take Hold of Our Future!!

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.390
This is Bagramon's D5?

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:52.220
Long ago, when Bagramon was making 
plans to take over the Digital World,

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.240
he learned of the human world,

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.240
<b>Avalon's Gate</b>

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.240
<b>Examon</b>

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:57.850
and his plans grew into 
something much bigger.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:01.700
He would absorb everyone in both the 
Digital and human worlds,

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.500
and create a world where 
he was in command.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.500
That's what D5 is.

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:11.340
We of the order of knights have 
been fighting to prevent this.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:12.880
But...

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:17.940
Unexpectedly, the advancement 
of human digital technology

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.480
<b>WarGreymon</b>

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.480
<b>Gaia Force</b>

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:21.290
brought the two worlds 
closer and closer together,

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.980
and that energy caused 
distortions in the core.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:29.350
Finally, the Digital World 
was divided and collapsed.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.260
The impact turned all of us 
knights into DigiMemories.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:36.870
WarGreymon and I fell into 
the space between dimensions.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.870
But thanks to that, 
they were able to save us.

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:42.760
I guess we should thank Tactimon, too.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.940
Tactimon?

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:49.360
We drifted about in the space between 
dimensions for a very long time.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:50.600
Then...

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:55.880
When Tactimon was thrown 
here from the Digital World,

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:58.120
he passed through the 
space between dimensions.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.650
They were caught in his wake 
and came here with him.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.030
We got stuck in the 
entrance to this realm,

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:10.900
and could only watch the battle 
between you and Tactimon.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.000
Then...

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.830
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:18.740
<i>What was that voice?</i>

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.640
<i>Pull us out!</i>

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.580
<i>Quickly!</i>

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:23.760
<i>DigiMemories?</i>

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.150
<i>They're sticking out of the air!</i>

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:31.050
If Akari and Zenjirou 
hadn't heard our voices,

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.190
you all might have ended up petrified.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:36.740
Honestly, you two, 
I can't believe your luck.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:39.900
But we were saved because of it.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:40.830
Kiriha...

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:43.050
I owe you my thanks, Akari...

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:43.700
Gengorou.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.690
My name is Zenjirou!

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.410
I'm sorry.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.000
It's my fault...

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.810
this happened to the world.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.080
Yuu...

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.410
Yuu? This is your brother, Nene?

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.750
Oh! So that's Nene's...

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:06.340
Yuu, it's not your fault.

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:09.530
You were deceived by DarkKnightmon.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:10.680
But...

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.300
It's not over yet. We're still here.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:15.610
And our friends are here, too, right?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.790
I don't have anyone anymore!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.590
Damemon died because of me.

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:26.080
Yuu, I'm sure Damemon is waiting.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.050
What?

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:28.550
Damemon is...

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.840
Yes. Digimon don't die.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.790
Even if they do, they can be reborn 
as long as their data remains.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:38.540
If we can restore the Code Crown 
that Bagramon stole, I'm sure...

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:45.260
But the Code Crown has 
turned into the Dark Stone.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.980
Can it be changed back?

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.600
Don't give up!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.400
You have to fight, Yuu, 
as long as there's a chance!

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:54.010
To take back the ones you care about...

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.210
To protect the ones you care about.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.860
That's why we've kept 
fighting all this time.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.650
But I don't...

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.160
You can do it.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.950
No... you're the only one who can.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.610
The Darkness Loader?

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.090
Fight with us,

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:12.850
as a General.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.340
Yuu.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.700
Kiriha...

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.250
You're not alone.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:25.760
Yuu...

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.160
Let's do it!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.290
Yuu!

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:33.580
Yuu.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.530
What a magnificent 
color of determination!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:50.060
Excellent, Yuu!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.700
And Taiki, and all of you, wonderful job 
drawing that determination from him!

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.120
Yuu!

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.140
I'm okay.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.510
Right! Let's resurrect Omegamon!

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:06.700
Taiki, take care of the other 
remaining DigiMemories!

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.200
<b>Omegamon</b>

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.200
<b>Grey Sword</b>

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:26.560
Farewell, incomplete humans.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:31.720
You are not ready to feel the 
power of my Digital World.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:37.280
You can at least be useful as the 
cornerstones of my new world.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:47.290
I see. I understand the plan.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:51.420
Indeed, with the power of all 
15 of us, it is not impossible.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:55.030
But are you sure about this, Taiki Kudou?

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:59.630
You will have to dive into 
extreme danger alone.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:03.540
I'll try, if it will allow me 
to save Shoutmon.

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.440
Yeah, I can't...

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.880
...turn my back on him!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.340
Right?

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.210
Yeah!

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:14.100
That's fine. We'll count on you.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.130
Just like we always have.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.200
Thanks.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.720
H-Hey, look at that!

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:28.130
Taiki Kudou and his friends?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.510
Your struggles are in vain!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.470
All right, the plan is in motion!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.530
Yuu!

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.090
I know you can do it!

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:34.830
Leave it to me!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:38.190
Akari, Zenjirou, 
I need you to support Yuu.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.220
Okay!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.900
Yuu, this is the moment of truth.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:43.420
I know, Taiki.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:44.610
Reload!

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.900
All right, let's go, everyone!

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.320
Yeah!

00:07:58.140 --> 00:07:59.420
Zeke Flame!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.490
Heartbreak Shot!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.570
Spicy Hard Love!

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:24.850
Dracomon! Cyberdramon!

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.890
DigiXros!

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:29.650
DigiXros!

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.970
Jijimon! Golemon! ChibiKamemon!

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.500
DigiXros!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.670
GolemJijiKamemon!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.840
Gaossmons! PawnChessmons!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.310
DigiXros!

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.250
PawnGaossmons!

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.950
Knightmon! Wisemon!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.580
DigiXros!

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.320
Knightmon Wise Sword Mode!

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:05.060
Knight!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.710
Wise Sword!

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:36.020
Ultimate Speaker!

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:43.930
Flower Cannon!

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.930
There, all set!

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:58.480
Okay.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.320
Let's go, Omegamon!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.510
Right, here we go, everyone!

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:03.350
Yeah!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.780
Go for it, Taiki!

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:07.350
Starting the countdown!

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.190
Go, Taiki Kudou!

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.670
Three... two... one...

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:10.450
Taiki!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.590
Zero!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.590
Akari?

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.050
Go!

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:17.300
Akari, why?

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:21.810
Because I couldn't let you go alone.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.760
We can't turn our backs on you!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.750
Okay.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.070
Hang on tight!

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:28.090
Okay!

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:30.130
All right, here we go!

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:41.820
<b>Original Digimon Contest! The Five Special Award Winners</b>

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:41.820
<b>5. The V Jump Award</b>

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:41.820
<b>Kenichi Ishii's Design</b>

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:41.820
<b>Bakomon</b>

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:46.960
Looks like we managed to 
get inside the Dark Stone.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:50.720
But our powers have reached their end.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:54.100
We leave the rest to you, Taiki.

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:55.980
Thanks, Omegamon.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.630
Shoutmon!

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:03.210
Shoutmon!

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.750
Shoutmon's not here?

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:07.750
He has to be.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.540
The Dark Stone is the 
Code Crown transformed.

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:13.920
So Shoutmon's scattered 
data must be in here.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:18.090
<i>Shoutmon, just like that day...</i>

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.130
<i>Just like the day we first met...</i>

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:24.360
<i>I'll find you!</i>

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.530
<i>I swear!</i>

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.600
Shoutmon!

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.800
Taiki...

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.870
Cutemon?

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:38.880
I tried to listen for Shoutmon, 
but it's no use.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.460
What happened to "I can't 
turn my back on him"?

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.490
Bagramon!

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:53.660
I never thought you would 
enact such a suicidal plan.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:58.310
You are indeed a terrifying 
General, Taiki Kudou.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:02.060
But you have lost.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.600
Be man enough to admit it.

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:05.340
Never!

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:07.820
Such a poor loser.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:11.490
If you won't admit it on your own, 
I'll have to force you to admit it.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:14.060
Behold your friends' final moments!

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:16.950
What's that?

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.740
What is that?

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:20.590
What?

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:34.420
Xros Open!

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.150
Hot! Hot!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:43.300
What? Bagramon's taking 
out his own army?!

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:45.180
He can't be serious!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:58.990
Death Divider!

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.890
Explosive Water Dragon! 
Explosive Water Dragon!

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.470
Nene! Protect Yuu!

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.710
Nene!

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.230
Kiriha! Nene is...

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:10.000
What?!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.400
Hurry!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.310
Let go of me!

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:17.140
Trident Fang!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:18.950
Monimon!

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.240
Breakthrough!

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.410
Sis!

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:25.220
Nene!

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.990
What in the world is that?!

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:32.030
That... is no ordinary flame...

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:33.850
Dorulumon!

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:36.200
It looks like fire at first glance,

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:39.560
but it's a highly powerful 
destroyer of data.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:40.970
Dorulumon!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:42.370
Cutemon, calm down!

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:44.170
Dorulumon's in trouble!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.670
I have to go heal him!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.690
There is no need for that.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:49.670
Taiki!

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:52.510
Let Taiki...

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:56.010
Supersonic Wave!

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:58.520
...go!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:01.740
Akari!

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:04.100
This is the end, Taiki Kudou.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:08.190
You, the human world, and the 
Digital World will all disappear,

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:11.300
and a perfect, new world will be born.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.360
I won't let you do that!

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:17.720
Why do you cling so stubbornly 
to an imperfect world?

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:22.370
Being remade by my hand would 
make it a far greater world,

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:25.110
with far greater lifeforms, as well.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:26.260
You're wrong!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.960
Both humans and Digimons 
have hearts that are free!

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.850
Not just humans!

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.080
Flowers, birds, fish, even bugs...

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.520
All creatures have the 
right to live freely!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.930
You can't do whatever you want with them!

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:43.560
Taiki!

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:46.430
Taiki!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:55.740
Taiki...

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:02.000
This argument is futile.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.450
Begone, last hope of all the fools.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.770
Shoutmon...

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.270
Yo!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.680
Shoutmon!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:40.950
Beelzebumon!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.680
Taiki!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.340
Too bad for you, Bagramon.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.290
You don't get to take 
over the world just yet!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:53.560
You've come back to life?! Why?

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.430
You can't hear it, can you?

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.030
The voices of the Code Crown!

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:02.040
What is all this?!

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.180
You wanna know? Then I'll tell you.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.750
The Code Crown has chosen Taiki, not you.

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:12.720
In other words, the Digital World 
has acknowledged Taiki.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:13.420
Then...

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.420
Hey, what's that?

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:28.430
We meet again, Kiriha.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.000
Deckerdramon!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.630
So Taiki's got the Code Crown, eh?

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:37.080
Everyone! Counterattack!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.220
They did it! They won!

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.300
Amazing!

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:02.450
Too bad, Bagramon.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.700
Then you all can die first.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:11.980
They got away?

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.190
Oh well.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.360
What's that?

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.320
Taiki!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:20.450
Shoutmon!

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:21.720
Hey!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.240
Beelzebumon!

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.050
Hey!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:29.670
You...

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:33.360
Thank goodness... thank goodness...

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:49.780
Everyone, let's end this battle!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:52.380
With the DigiXros that 
the Code Crown taught us!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.310
Here we go, everyone!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:17.390
Final Xros!

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:34.860
No matter how many weaklings 
combine their data, it's still useless.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.690
I don't think so!

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:40.000
We're gonna grab the future 
with our own strength!

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:45.570
What?!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:57.570
I am the future Digimon King!

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.920
Wow, awesome!

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.380
Final Xros!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:24.240
Shoutmon X7 Superior Mode!

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:26.810
Foolish!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:32.880
Perish, old world!

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:49.430
Time to finish this!

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.190
Final Xros Blade!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:15.460
My ideals... my conviction...

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:19.500
Bagramon...

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.570
If you ever make a mistake 
again, I'll stop you.

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:28.730
We'll meet again someday, in my kingdom.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.140
All right!

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.780
Bye! See you next time!

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.990
All those Digimon appeared,

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.140
but not Damemon.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:05.590
But I believe Damemon is 
alive again, somewhere.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:05.940
Yuu...

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:09.870
Like you said, Taiki, I can't give 
up as long as there's a chance.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.750
I can't turn my back on Damemon!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.910
Yuu...

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:15.950
Guess that takes care of that!

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:21.650
Taiki, I've gotta go rebuild 
the Digital World, and then...

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:22.740
Become the king.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:25.130
Yeah! I owe it all to you!

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.600
Thanks, Taiki!

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:43.920
The battle is over.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:50.530
Peace returned to the world, 
and our hot summer ended.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:55.000
Of course, summer will 
come again one day,

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.810
but that's another story.

00:21:58.430 --> 00:21:59.720
Taiki!

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:01.050
Taiki!

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:04.900
<b>The End</b>

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:09.770
And On to a New Adventure...

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:09.770
The story still continues!

