Khorošó Attack</b>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:28.550
Troopmon.

00:22:28.550 --> 00:22:30.390
His special attack is Death March.

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:33.890
He's like a machine that does 
nothing but follow orders.

00:22:33.890 --> 00:22:36.480
He just works all the time, 
never even sleeping!

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:39.740
I'd rather sleep all the 
time and never work!
